      <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 30px;">Want to taste what ancient heirloom genetics, high-altitude growing, and careful whole-food processing actually produce? Explore Pacha Mana's Chuncho ceremonial cacao.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
