      </div>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); margin: 22px 0 0;">More from the guide: <a href="/cacao-powder-vs-ceremonial-cacao" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">cacao powder vs ceremonial cacao</a> and <a href="/raw-cacao-myth" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">why raw cacao is a myth</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Series band -->
